   "source": [
    "## Agentic PDF Research Assistant — Walkthrough\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook walks through the entire pipeline for the project — from loading a PDF to building a full agentic RAG system using **LangChain**, **FAISS**, and **LangGraph**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Everything here is also in the deployed app (`app.py`, `graph.py`, `ingestion.py`), but this notebook breaks it down step-by-step with explanations.\n",
    "\n",
    "**The Pipeline:**\n",
    "`PDF → Chunking → Embeddings → FAISS → Classify → Retrieve/Summarize → Generate → Answer`\n",
    "\n",
    "### Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "Before you run this:\n",
    "1. Add a `.env` file in this folder with `GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here` (free API key from [console.groq.com](https://console.groq.com))\n",
    "2. Place a sample PDF in this folder and update `PDF_PATH` below\n",
    "3. Install dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "id": "5b10b72a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# If running for the first time, run this to install the required modules\n",
    "# %pip install langchain langchain-community langchain-core langchain-text-splitters langchain-huggingface langchain-groq langgraph faiss-cpu sentence-transformers pypdf python-dotenv\n",
    "\n",
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "print(load_dotenv())\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "NOTEBOOK_DIR = os.getcwd()  # Avoid directory issues when running the notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "PDF_PATH = os.path.join(NOTEBOOK_DIR, \"sample.pdf\")\n"
   ]
  },
