   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 1 — Loading the PDF\n",
    "\n",
    "`PyPDFLoader` loads each page as a separate `Document` object (not one giant blob of text). Each doc has:\n",
    "- `page_content`: the text from that page\n",
    "- `metadata`: includes the page number, which we'll use for citations later\n",
    "\n",
    "*Note: This pipeline only extracts text, so images won't be included.*\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "id": "8ad550b7",
