   "source": [
    "### Step 4 — Building a FAISS Index\n",
    "\n",
    "FAISS (Facebook AI Similarity Search) lets us quickly find the most similar chunks for any query. We'll save the index so we don't have to re-embed everything each time.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
